{
    "name": "FAIRe mapper: propose a mapping",
    "a_galaxy_workflow": "true",
    "format-version": "0.1",
    "annotation": "The first step from a lab's own sample table to a FAIRe workbook. Profiles the columns of the\nsample table, proposes a FAIRe term for each (a review sheet and a crosswalk for review), lists the\nmandatory FAIRe terms not yet covered and the additional checks to make (a sample name used twice,\ncontrols not marked, columns of notes, times with no time zone), and finds the primer pairs a methods\ntext names, cites or gives as sequences. Fill in the review sheet, then run \"FAIRe mapper: write and\ncheck a FAIRe workbook\".",
    "tags": [],
    "license": "MIT",
    "release": "0.3",
    "uuid": "5764cb7d-4f44-41c9-a2e7-142bdc937e44",
    "creator": [
        {
            "name": "FAIRe Galaxy project contributors",
            "class": "Organization"
        }
    ],
    "comments": [],
